I've been saying for awhile (to people in meatspace) that I wouldn't
mind seeing ceiling-holes, but I think the advent of such would beg
for, almost _require_, the addition of a new tool: the movable ladder.
How nice would that be? Of course, for an uncursed one, you'd have a
chance perhaps to slip and fall (more damage than falling off a horse,
I'd think), and a very small chance to break the ladder while doing so
(increased with extra carried junk- perhaps a warning message could be
implemented ("The ladder seems liable to collapse under your weight.
Continue?")); blessed would negate the former risk and increase the
carrying capacity of the ladder; cursed would make it very likely to
break apart. And of course, for some reason, possession of the Amulet
would have a side-effect of breaking all ladders you tried to climb.

